# Automation Runtime Debug

## Safety-Critical Checks

- Ensure injected input runs on the render/main thread.
- Keep API handlers fail-closed with JSON errors (no dropped connections).
- Preserve replay determinism when changing timing or coordinate models.

## API and Payload Rules

- Use explicit coordinate fields (`xPx`, `yPx`, `xNorm`, `yNorm`).
- Keep backward compatibility when renaming payload fields.
- Avoid large inline screenshot payloads by default.

## Validation

- Verify health/state/click/type/replay endpoints after changes.
- Confirm only one app window/process is used during automation validation.
